## HOLDS (carried; unchanged unless named)
- **No write on demo before `GO DEMO (Seat D 69th)`.** No write on Kintsugi unless `GO KINTSUGI (Seat D 69th)` arrives for a k33.
- **No migration applied** (any apply, or a tracker move, is a STOP). 059 / PR 2099 never.
- **Nothing deleted** on either box: no prune, no image rm, no `docker system prune`, no `--remove-orphans`; rollback tags, seat dirs and earlier seats' files kept (earlier D seats' dirs READ-ONLY; ask for `.rebuild-seatD69`).
- **No test write:** no create, key, login, document, tenant or user row, no anchor POST, no chain call, no Stripe call, no credential use, no POST to prism; no admin settings save; no login with ANY demo account (the ADMIN CREDENTIALS hold).
- No `az`, no `--no-verify`, no force push, no `--admin`; no `cd`, no `rm` (move to a dated `_quarantine_YYYY-MM-DD/`); absolute paths; `cmd > out 2>&1; rc=$?`; `/usr/bin/grep -i` with a positive control beside every zero; zsh: no unquoted word starting with `=`.
- Never read, echo or copy a secret; hashes and variable NAMES only; no credential in argv.
- **Stop-and-mail on:** a REVISION head other than expected (demo `07a2d62be6a0`, Kintsugi `8292da2c9dbc`); a prior or idfp mismatch; a build failure (root cause, re-verify, never skip); a gate NOT EQUAL; a non-final anchor row before the anchoring swap; the floor watchdog; OOM; any migration file in the pin or tracker move; KS-535 equality or a wrong value; a held service in your sets; a REBUILT count other than STATUS A's; a D8.1/D8.2 positive count; an open PR in the pin; anything needing Kam (production, money, a human, irreversible). A rollback is a STOP and mail.
- **Never leave demo mid-deploy:** at about 70% context finish the item in hand; at about 75% HANDOVER and wrap, but FINISH the swap or ROLL BACK first.

